    示例7 - 多种价格类型（重要示例）：
    如果文档中有多种价格类型但价格相同，应该这样处理：
    {
        "node_name": "门票",
        "price_conditions": [
            {
                "price": 100,
                "unit": "人次",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "condition_name": "门市价",
                        "condition_value": "门市价",
                        "restrictions": []
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "price": 100,
                "unit": "人次",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "condition_name": "团队价",
                        "condition_value": "团队价",
                        "restrictions": [
                            {
                                "restriction_type": "团队人数",
                                "operator": "≥",
                                "value": "10人"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "price": 100,
                "unit": "人次",
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "condition_name": "学生价",
